OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry and
OL,6,Fclear during the evening with light
OL,7,Fwinds, a light frost is likely but
OL,8,Fbecoming cloudier later in the night
OL,9,Fwith rain spreading north into
OL,10,FSouthern Aberdeenshire around dawn.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FA bright start for Moray but
OL,13,Frain spreading north across all areas,
OL,14,Fpersistent at times in the east and
OL,15,Fbecoming windy here too. Perhaps
OL,16,Fclearer in the west later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
