OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FRather
OL,6,Funsettled over the weekend despite a
OL,7,Fbright start on Saturday, rain and
OL,8,Fstrong winds spread east. Showery
OL,9,FSunday but accompanied by gales.
OL,10,FPerhaps a brighter day Monday, rain
OL,11,Flater.
